 Multi-Tool AI Agent for Bangladesh 🇧🇩

A LangChain-powered AI Agent that intelligently answers questions about **Bangladesh institutions, hospitals, and restaurants** using SQLite databases and performs **general knowledge searches** using a web search tool.



📌 Project Overview

This project builds a **Multi-Tool AI Agent** capable of answering both structured data queries and general knowledge questions.

The agent automatically chooses the appropriate tool based on the user's query.

Supported Features

* 🏫 Query Bangladeshi educational institutions
* 🏥 Query Bangladeshi hospitals
* 🍽️ Query Bangladeshi restaurants
* 🌐 Search the web for general knowledge
* 🤖 Automatic tool selection using LangChain



🛠️ Technologies Used

* Python 3.11+
* LangChain
* LangChain Community
* SQLite
* Pandas
* Tavily Search API (or another supported search API)
* OpenAI GPT Models


📊 Datasets

This project uses the following Hugging Face datasets:

### Institutional Information of Bangladesh

https://huggingface.co/datasets/Mahadih534/Institutional-Information-of-Bangladesh

### All Bangladeshi Hospitals

https://huggingface.co/datasets/Mahadih534/all-bangladeshi-hospitals

### Bangladeshi Restaurant Data

https://huggingface.co/datasets/Mahadih534/Bangladeshi-Restaurant-Data


⚙️ Installation

Clone the repository

bash
git clone https://github.com/KauserAhmedAnik/Question_ans_Assistant.git

cd Question_ans_Assistant


Install dependencies

bash
pip install -r requirements.txt


🔑 Environment Variables

Create a `.env` file in the project root.

Example:

env
OPENAI_API_KEY=your_openai_api_key
TAVILY_API_KEY=your_tavily_api_key

# 🗄️ Database Creation

Run the following command to convert the CSV datasets into SQLite databases.

bash
python scripts/csv_to_SQlite.py


This will generate:


institutions.db

hospitals.db

restaurants.db

Database connection

bash 
python scripts/SQL_connections.py

this will the database with system

# ▶️ Running the Project

Start the AI Agent by running:

bash
python app.py



🤖 Available Tools

tools:

InstitutionsDBTool

Handles queries related to:

* Universities
* Colleges
* Schools
* Government Institutions
* EIIN Information
* Educational Statistics



HospitalsDBTool

Handles queries related to:

* Hospitals
* Clinics
* Doctors
* Bed Capacity
* Medical Facilities
* Emergency Services



RestaurantsDBTool

Handles queries related to:

* Restaurants
* Cuisine
* Location
* Ratings
* Food Categories



WebSearchTool

Handles general knowledge questions that are not available in the local databases.

Examples:

* Healthcare policy of Bangladesh
* DGHS
* Medical education
* Government organizations
* General information



