🧠 Agent Workflow


                    User Query
                         │
                         ▼
                 Main LangChain Agent
                         │
        ┌──────────┬──────────┬──────────┬──────────┐
        ▼          ▼          ▼          ▼
 Hospital Tool Institution Restaurant Web Search
        │          │          │          │
        ▼          ▼          ▼          ▼
 Hospitals.db Institutions.db Restaurants.db Internet
```

The AI Agent automatically selects the appropriate tool based on the user's query.

